 "bit_exact_detail": "In every run and cell the bench asserts torch.equal of the logits of the 64-row tile, the base_1107 and candidate heads, and of the greedy pairs of the 64-row partials, both heads' certified screens and greedy_shard_pair on the logits (all four runs completed); the logits and pairs hashes are equal across all four runs of both arms in every cell; sab's four layers give equal pairs in every cell of both boots.",
